    <mxCell id="t_155" value="Configures only:&lt;br&gt;• its own service principal&lt;br&gt;• the API's app name&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Handshake:&lt;br&gt;0  GET /api/v1/connection → topic,&lt;br&gt;    bootstrap servers, credential&lt;br&gt;1  PUT /api/v1/subscriptions (SQL)&lt;br&gt;    → ACCEPTED or Databricks' error&lt;br&gt;2  GET ?wait → READY (~5 s)&lt;br&gt;3  read its own topic (Kafka,&lt;br&gt;    OAUTHBEARER, UC token)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica,Arial;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4A148C;" vertex="1" parent="c_150">
      <mxGeometry x="15" y="440" width="260" height="270" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="t_156" value="• OAuth M2M as its own SP&lt;br&gt;• no Azure secret in the app&lt;br&gt;• Kafka token from Unity Catalog&lt;br&gt;  (its sub_&amp;lt;app&amp;gt;_eventhubs)&lt;br&gt;• exits non-zero, never silent&lt;br&gt;• never skips a match" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica,Arial;fontSize=10;fontColor=#2E7D32;" vertex="1" parent="c_150">
      <mxGeometry x="15" y="40" width="260" height="130" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
